(text "P0 REVIEW ONLY | Power links JP1-JP8 OPEN | No OLED footprint | Module harness order defined here; verify module end separately." (at 14 13.2 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "a5256a2d-d5a9-5350-ad76-9c537330a467"))
(text "POWER: 5V source -> reverse polarity FET -> Blue Pill onboard regulator + independent AUX regulator. NEVER JOIN 3V3_BP AND 3V3_AUX." (at 14 46 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "d8dd9afb-e25b-587b-8ae7-ac2e8b913e74"))
(text "Blue Pill nominal rows: 20 pins, pitch 2.54mm, row spacing 15.24mm. J2/J3 pin 1 at SWD end. Actual board measurement required." (at 14.000 52.500 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "af918a56-12d8-5f6d-abdf-d33e9aec374f"))
(text "I2C: MPU AD0 high, address 0x69; RTC 0x68. Pullups R1/R2 DNP until module pullups audited. Failed MPU/SD tests remain unresolved." (at 14.000 115.500 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "2cf10b87-1fee-549f-a468-d72dc2494005"))
(text "Sensor supply links are isolated by default. SD/GPS candidate 5V must NOT be connected until breakout regulators / logic are identified." (at 14.000 171.500 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "5e765857-f82e-5e49-8ef3-0baee4e30b72"))
(text "PB12 SW420 is proposed, not hardware-tested. Older firmware PIN_SW420=PB15; synchronize before bring-up." (at 14.000 227.500 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "74898f23-662d-50de-8acb-457bd27242c2"))
(text "LEDs have 330-ohm resistors. Buzzer has transistor + flyback diode; candidate load <=20mA / 5V pending actual buzzer specifications." (at 14.000 283.500 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "8f8b09d2-abb2-5af5-a2db-59b7cec2f727"))
(text "SWD requires J14 cable to the separate Blue Pill SWD header. J15 has NO power output. J16 is unpopulated VTref SENSE ONLY." (at 14.000 339.500 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "965b6333-c13d-5d44-92ef-812d96aa97d7"))
